error: `Process.wait` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  `Process.wait` waits for another program to end
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_process_wait_async.sg:3:21
 3 |     _ = try process.wait()
   |                     ^^^^
  hint: `await process.waitAsync()` does the same work without holding the thread
